WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
Jamie dashes after the prerequisite light Arrow Kick.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.050
The second dash closes the wake-up distance.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.500
Standing medium punch trades with Ken’s recorded wake-up attack.

4
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.000
Crouching heavy punch connects after the trade.

5
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.250
Light Arrow Kick launches Ken from the heavy link.

6
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.050
Ken falls after the light Arrow juggle.
